      "steps": "<ol><li>Faktorkan pembilang: $2x^2 - 8 = 2(x^2 - 4) = 2(x - 2)(x + 2)$.</li><li>Faktorkan penyebut: $x^2 + 3x + 2 = (x + 1)(x + 2)$.</li><li>Bagi faktor persekutuan $(x + 2)$: $\\frac{2(x - 2)(x + 2)}{(x + 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{2(x - 2)}{x + 1}$.</li></ol>",
